feat: add SEO/OG infrastructure - metadata, sitemap, robots, OG image

generateMetadata now reads locale-aware profile.tagline for description
and OpenGraph/Twitter cards, plus metadataBase and alternate-language
links. Branded opengraph-image.tsx renders name/role/tagline on the
ink/cobalt palette via next/og. sitemap.ts enumerates every locale x
route (home, blog list, case studies, posts); robots.ts allows all and
points at the sitemap. SITE_URL centralized in libs/site.ts, overridable
via NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL.

Verified in-browser: opengraph-image renders at 1200x630, sitemap.xml
lists all routes, robots.txt references the sitemap.

